			"notes": "Adds 65 missing modules from the previous Aiden, Kawaii and Satellite ports to the existing 39 modules (104 total). Imported modules use the native Combat, Movement, Player, Render and Misc ClickGUI lists. Existing Reach, Anchor Macro, Crystal Macro and Backtrack implementations are retained to avoid duplicates.\n\nRequires AUTISM Client 5.0-26.2, Minecraft 26.2, Fabric Loader 0.19.3+, Fabric API 0.152.2+26.2 and Java 25. Close Minecraft and replace the previous addon JAR. Remove the standalone Aiden, Kawaii and Satellite port JARs from that profile.\n\nBuild, registration, utility guards, Spotify helper checks and an isolated client game test passed. Multiplayer behavior and every individual module were not exhaustively tested.\n\nThe requested top-level IMPORTED_MODULES.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md are omitted. Original license texts remain under licenses/.\n\nJAR SHA-256: `6647b68c49e065702ca83e2603b541684ba758e7bebdd38558f3952c1c6b661a`"
